### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Basic Search
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=laptop&size=5

### Search Electronics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?category=Electronics&size=10

### Search with Price Filter
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=headphones&minPrice=500&maxPrice=3000

### Search with Multiple Filters
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?category=Clothing&brand=Nike&minRating=4&inStock=true

### Sort by Price (Low to High)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=shoes&sortBy=price_asc&size=10

### Sort by Rating
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?sortBy=rating&size=10

### Autocomplete
GET http://localhost:3000/api/autocomplete?q=sam

### Autocomplete - Phone
GET http://localhost:3000/api/autocomplete?q=phone

### Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/PROD-000001

### Get Similar Products
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/PROD-000001/similar?size=5

### Get Statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stats

### Search with Pagination
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?query=electronic&page=2&size=20

### Search by Tag
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?tags=bestseller&size=10

### Search In Stock + High Rating
GET http://localhost:3000/api/search?inStock=true&minRating=4.5&sortBy=popular